s using Selenium. Experience in integrating automated tests within continuous integration and continuous delivery pipelines. Ability to analyze test results and troubleshoot issues to ensure software quality. Familiarity with test management tools and defect tracking systems. Knowledge of scripting and programming concepts to enhance test automation frameworks. The candidate should have minimum 5 years of experience in Selenium. This position is based at our Gurugram office. A 15 years full time education is required.\n Qualification 15 years full time education\n\nKey Skills: Automated Test Scripts,Automation,Continuous Delivery,Automated Testing,Software Products,Defect Tracking,Plsql,Programming"}]